        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Teton Valley Trails and Pathways – Brush Mower</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/47036.webp" alt="Teton Valley Trails and Pathways – Brush Mower" loading="lazy">
